{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22911","headline":"酬赠李链师见招 · 白居易","name":"酬赠李链师见招","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几年司谏直承明，今日求真礼上清。\n曾犯龙鳞容不死，欲骑鹤背觅长生。\n刘纲有妇仙同得，伯道无儿累更轻。\n若许移家相近住，便驱鸡犬上层城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}